      "side": 1,
      "message": "We don\u0027t have any other emulators in platform/ec/zephyr/emul that are like this one. Our other emulators are faking out specific hardware, not providing a generic device like this.\n\nHowever this is very similar to the gpio_emul in zephyr itself, to provide gpios on native_posix.\n\nI think this is a good thing to have, and putting it into platform/ec/zephyr/emul still seems like the right thing to do. \n\nAnother approach would be to make a emulator specific to one of the chips, then for tests you could configure the driver for that chip and also the emulator for that chip.",
